Reason: give FLOCK its own processed root (data/roots/flock/) so the cache in processed/data.pt cannot be shared with another repo's pre_transform. Upstream points both paths at ~/flock, which exists in no container here. Defaults are supplied so an unset variable is still a valid path rather than a jinja error.

